  "title": "Ermenegildo Zegna Group to Report First Quarter 2026 Unaudited Revenues on April 30, 2026",
  "summary": "April 16, 2026 – MILAN — Ermenegildo Zegna N.V. (NYSE: ZGN) (the “Company” and, together with its consolidated subsidiaries, the “Ermenegildo Zegna Group” or “the Group”) today announced that it will report its unaudited revenues for the first quarter of 2026 on Thursday, April 30, 2026, at 6:00 a.m. ET (12:00 p.m. CET). A conference call will follow at 7:00 a.m. ET (1:00 p.m. CET) and will also be accessible through a live webcast. Please refer to the details below. The related press release an",
